### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "asdf3@email.com",
    "password": "123456"
}


### Find all users
GET http://localhost:3000/auth?email=asdf1@email.com

### Find a user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/1


### Update an user
PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/15
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "newPassword"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/auth/3